"local_font"="font/Press Start 2P.ttf";
"local_fontBold"="font/Press Start 2P.ttf";
// 튜토리얼
"local_tutorialtalk01 "="@eye:This is the human world.{There are dungeons that demon magic cannot reach yet.{Take each dungeon one by one to expand your power.{Your evaluation is shown through these infamy levels.";
"local_tutorialtalk02 "="@eye:Let's go to the first dungeon.";
"local_tutorialtalk03 "="@eye:Cozy, isn't it?{Human warriors are bound to visit notorious dungeons, but that will take time…{Let's use dark magic instead.{It's a device that enables us to call up knights whenever we want.";
"local_tutorialtalk04 "="@eye:With time you can use your magic to activate these devices and selected knights will enter the dungeon. {Please pull it.";
"local_tutorialtalk05 "="@eye:Humans have a tendency to not think about their choices and simply check their results.@hero:I feel the aura of evil!@eye:Hehe… let's see what this knight's choice will bring!";
"local_tutorialtalk06 "="@eye:Excellent! You are, master, truly of the side of darkness.";
"local_tutorialtalk07 "="@eye:Congratulations. You have conquered the dungeon.{Because of its high infamy, no one will dare come here again.{Let's go to a bigger dungeon.";
"local_tutorialtalk08 "="@eye:Do you like your new dungeon?{Now position your monsters. The first dungeon's monsters were like samples.{Because your Monster Box is empty, let's pick a monster.{Select SUMMON Monster on the menu.";
"local_tutorialtalk09 "="@eye:You won't know what you'll get, but that's part of the fun.{It's a rule of magic that what comes to you easily will cost you later.{Since you have enough gold, pick a monster.";
"local_tutorialtalk10 "="@eye:You got this one. Strengthening it may be useful for you.{You may have noticed it already, but the more stars the monster has, the rarer and more capable it is.";
"local_tutorialtalk11 "="@eye:Picked monster cards are in the Monster Box.";
"local_tutorialtalk12 "="@eye:The number of stars on the top-left corner is the COST of placing the monster in the dungeon.{When your infamy rises, so does the cost.";
"local_tutorialtalk13 "="@eye:Be victorious in battle, collect monsters, and raise your infamy!\nThat is what you must do in this world.{Then I'll see you the next time you need help.{I'll leave you with 10,000 coins so you can call forth and position more monsters.";
"local_tutorialtalk14 "="@eye:전투에서 많은 승리를 거둬서 강력한 몬스터들을 모으고 악명 레벨을 높이는 것!\n그것이 주인님이 이 세계에서 할 일입니다.{그럼 저는 다음 도움이 필요할 때 다시 오도록 하겠습니다.\n10000골드를 드릴테니 몬스터를 더 뽑아서 배치시킨다음 전투를 시작하세요";

"local_tutorialtalkbattle01"="@eye:The first line of warriors have fire powers, so monsters with water powers shall be useful in the first battle.{Since it's manual combat in this case, you can decide their order.{ The warriors have fire powers, so pick a monster with water powers (marked blue).";
"local_tutorialtalkbattle02"="@eye:Monsters that have been attacked by many warriors get to use one 'lethal blow' on warriors.{Quickly press the skill button and see.";
"local_tutorialtalkbattle03"="@eye:All dungeons have a trap room.\nWatch what happens when you have a trap card.";

//스킵 시도
"local_tutorialtalkskip00"="@eye:Wait, master! Hear me out until the end!\nI'll give you more gold! It'll only take a moment.";
"local_tutorialtalkskip01"="@eye:Here are the rules in a nutshell:{1) Win as many battles as possible with the warriors called forth.\n2) Collect gold and call forth monsters or strengthen them.\n3) Raise your infamy through victory.\nThese are the things you must do in this world.{Then I shall return the next time you need help.";

