"local_talkeventsystemherohpdown "="The HP of the knights in the dungeon have decreased.";
"local_talkeventsystemdealmonsterlevelup "="Would you like to temporarily strengthen the monsters using gold?";
"local_talkeventsystemdealgem "="Would you like to accept the deal?";
