"local_talkeventsystemgetexp "="You have gained %d in gold.";

// ** 순서 꼭 지켜야함 ** //
// 이벤트
"local_talkeventswordcatenter "="@sword_cat:Hello! Meow. {Is this the infamous dungeon of the Underlord? My name is Toby, and I am a swordsfeline. {My special charms and wit pleased my master, who then taught me my skill. {I heard a lot of warriors left the village to come here, so I came to visit. {I'm just here to pick up dropped coins, if you will. {Pay me no attention!";
"local_talkeventswordcatlose "="@sword_cat:(Arg!!) Please, spare me!!! {I'll give you all the money I have {just spare my life! {(Darn it, I'll return with better skills!) #get gold";
"local_talkeventswordcatwin "="@sword_cat:All I wanted was to pick up a few coins… {Your monsters don't live up to the hype. {Nyah nyah nyah nyah nyah) #lose gold";
"local_talkeventswordcatenterlose "="@sword_cat:(Meow) I return! {Sorry for what happened last time. {I've got starving kittens at home… {I'll just pick up some dropped change and be off. {(For sure this time!)";
"local_talkeventswordcatenterwin "="@sword_cat:(Meow) Remember me, Underlord? Hehe {I'll be taking some more gold. {(This dungeon is sure to be the same flimsy operation?)";
"local_talkeventmysterywoman "="@mystery_woman:… {My husband is in a far off land… {I hope he's eating all his meals… {I better help out as much as I can. #monsters level up";
"local_talkeventprincessenter "="@princess:… This is the place! {I'm determined to meet the Underlord today!";
"local_talkeventprincessexit "="@princess:Ah!!!!";
"local_talkeventprincesssuccess "="@princess:Ah, finally! {We meet, Underlord. {I am a princess of a fallen kingdom, {and my only wish is to avenge my home. {Please! {Let me serve you! #get succubus card";
"local_talkeventkingenter "="@king:It wasn't easy coming here under cover! {I was hoping to put in a good word for myself {before the demons rule the world again. {Here is some gold for that. {May your infamy rise! #get gold2";
"local_talkeventkingafter "="@king:I have returned, great Underlord. {I am at your command, hehe…#get gold2";
"local_talkeventmerchantenter "="@merchant:How do you do, Underlord? {I'm a merchant of magic, peddling my wares in both the human and inhuman world, anywhere that's profitable. {I can raise the levels of your monsters in this battle, would you like that? (3000 gold) #deal monsters level up";
"local_talkeventmerchantrefuse "="@merchant:Well, never mind then. {Maybe the knights will buy?";
"local_talkeventmerchantaccpet "="@merchant:It will be a great help to you in battle! {I'll come again soon. #monsters level up";
"local_talkeventseniorpriestenter "="@senior_priest:You fiendish thing! {The warriors of legend shall crush you!! {In the name of God, {demons be gone!! #hero levels up;
"local_talkeventwitchesenter "="@witches:Dear Underlord♥ You are here!!!{I'm glad we followed those knights! {Cackles {We've poisoned the warriors~ {Hopefully you shall win this battle!♥ #hero hp down";
"local_talkeventfairiesenter "="@warrior: Uh… this looks like a good place to up my levels. {It's not the main quest or anything. @fairy: Rumor has it the Underlord is growing other dungeons. {Be careful! @warrior: Hehe, I don't care about Underlords… {I'm the hero of my story!";
"local_talkeventwarriorlose "="@warrior: Ugh… can't believe it… I can't die here without having seen the ending… @fairy: … Didn't I tell you to be careful! {Try bargaining for your life.{Underlord, we shall give you something if you spare us.#deal gem";
"local_talkeventwarriordie "="@fairy: Oh no! I knew it… {A demon wouldn't listen to reason… @warrior: Aaaah, I don't want to die! @fairy:… It's OK. You'll be resurrected in the village.#get gold3";
"local_talkeventwarrioralive "="@fairy: Oh thank you! {(Come on, let's get out of here!) @warrior: Darn… such a waste… {(I'll be back after I become stronger)#get gem";
"local_talkeventwarriorwin "="@warrior: Aha! I knew it was nothing. {Glad I kept strengthening my weapon! {So Underlord, I'll see you later? @fairy: Let's get out of here and go back to the main quest!";
"local_talkeventwarriorafter "="@warrior: Is this the Underlord's dungeon, too? Wonder if he got any better. @fairy: Don't be so arrogant. Concentrate! @warrior: Ha, I can slay any monster that comes my way!";

// ** 순서 꼭 지켜야함 ** //
// 에피소드
"local_episodetalk01 "="@blank: Episode 1. A Knight Discovers the Dungeon@hero: The stories of monsters run amok are true! {Better go back to the village and spread the news!@eye: Ooh! Master's infamy grows by the day!@hero: Er, shouldn't you be nervous?";
"local_episodetalk02 "="@blank: Episode 2. What Makes a Knight@hero: There are many kinds of warriors. {I'm just a beginner but once I become a better knight {I'll conquer this pitiful dungeon! @eye: Hello? 9-1-1? Can I make a reservation for someone?@hero: Make a reservation for yourself!!";
"local_episodetalk03 "="@blank: Episode 3. Kitty Swordsman@sword_cat: Hello! I am Puss! In Hat!@hero: You're a little, uh, different? From the others?@sword_cat: I hear the Underlord's Dungeon is proving to be a challenge. {I love. Challenges.@hero: Sure. Anyway, kick some sand over your poo before leaving?@eye: Kick some sand over what now?";
"local_episodetalk04 "="@blank: Episode 4. Knight's Interface@eye: Welcome to the Dungeon!@hero: Uh-oh. {I can't return without killing the boss monster. Too embarrassing!@eye: Wouldn't you rather be monster fodder than go back to being unemployed?@hero: No, I'm going to re-load from my last saved position.@eye: You… you can do that?";
"local_episodetalk05 "="@blank: Episode 5. Building a Relationship@hero: Hey, eyeball! {Looking out (get it?) for our knights today?@eye: Don't get all friendly with me. {I don't fraternize with knights on their way to the meat grinder.@hero: Yeah? {They'll just resurrect me at my village. {So lighten up!@eye: Fine, knight. Here's a riddle. {A knight, a Viking, and an elf entered a dungeon, but only the elf died. Guess why.@hero: … The elf had the lowest power level?@eye: Ha. It's because the elf went in first. {That's how dungeons work. {First in, first dead. {So pay attention to where you get in line.@hero: A monster just gave me advice. {How moving.@eye: I'm not saying I'm always going to put you in as third. {Now back to our professional boundaries.";
"local_episodetalk06 "="@blank: Episode 6. Boss Monster's Secret@hero: Yaysies! I'm returning alive! After a fashion.@sword_cat: Mwaha! I'm returning with a pile of gold.@eye: You fools! You were merely lucky. All you got were the minor monsters!@hero: Au contraire, we were defeated by the boss monster, but he said he'd use that day's mileage points to spare us.@eye: He'll never get ahead of inflation that way.";
"local_episodetalk07 "="@blank: Episode 7. Main Quest@hero: I've discovered something important!@eye: You're being serious for a change.@hero: I'm on the Collecting Ancient Fragments quest, and in them was a picture of the Underlord and God.@hero: That the ancients depicted the Underlord and God as being side-by-side. {What do you make of it?@eye: Well… I barely survived the last demon extinction event, {and the Underlord was resurrected without memory. {Not even he knows much of the past.@hero: I'm going to finish collecting these fragments.@eye: Ooh… a plot, it be thickening!";
"local_episodetalk08 "="@blank: Episode 8. Key to Solving the Quest@sword_cat: You know that Collecting Ancient Fragments quest thingie?@eye: Oh that thingie. That main quest thingie.@sword_cat: The knight says it's a key to the Underlord's past, {and I happen to have the last piece.@eye: What, you want to make a deal for it?! You want to taste my saliva? {Give it here!@sword_cat: Gah! Don't be yucky. Or murderous. {Forget it! I'll deal with the knight instead!";
"local_episodetalk09 "="@blank: Episode 9. Mutual Understanding@hero: Now that there are several dungeons, I don't know which to target.@eye: Difficulty varies depending on monster positioning and power levels. {But it's advantageous to try a dungeon that has lots of strong knights.@hero: On the other hand, the monsters are more varied and one has to power up.@eye: The length of the corridor also influences how the knights wait. {The system isn't simple.";
"local_episodetalk10 "="@blank: Episode 10. The Princess's Adventure@princess: Is this the Underlord's Dungeon?@eye: Yes it… crikey! {A human princess!@princess: The human world is a mess. {Demons are being scapegoated and everyone is being sent into war. {Comic books and games with demons in them are being burned. {But I can't imagine adventure without evil.@eye: So you're here because of regulation against games?@princess: I know enough of the world above, now I want to know the world below. {I'm like, really adventurous. {I want to meet the Underlord!@eye: Bizarre. {Well, test your luck then. {If you can reach the boss monster, you might even get to meet the Underlord!";
"local_episodetalk11 "="@blank: Episode 11. Common Quest@hero: A princess is here in the dungeon? {There was a sub-quest on rescuing a princess. {I was about to buy a good sword with my quest earnings.@eye: Yeah, she was here. Already became a sexy female monster or some such.@hero: My God! A sexy female monster… {Gah! {I've got to meet her!@eye: … {You sure it's rescuing you have in mind?";
"local_episodetalk12 "="@blank: Episode 12. The Underlord's Past@hero: I've completed the Collecting Ancient Fragments quest, but found something weird.@eye: What is it?@hero: I think people used to worship the Underlord.@eye: Worship the Underlord… you mean demons?@hero: That would mean demons and humans lived together. {Anyway, the only thing I got out of this quest was that and experience levels.@eye: The Underlord's past… {What kind of relationship did the Underlord and God have?";
"local_episodetalk13 "="@blank: Episode 13. The Knight's Powerful Competitor@warrior: Aha! What is yon eyeball?@fairy: Calm down. {That's the Underlord's Dungeon. {It's filled with demons, not ordinary animals.@eye: Eh. A warrior with a fairy sidekick. {A hero with the proper accessories!@warrior: Of course I'm the hero! {The fairy is just a sidekick!@fairy: (This idiot… {Getting all excited again…)@sword_cat: Being strong or having high levels does not a hero make. {It is effortful story catalysts like me who are true heroes.@warrior: Fie on your effortful story cat-whatever! {You know what you're made of only in combat. {Destroying you will make me free from all. {One must lose everything if one wants true freedom.@sword_cat: I've heard that before…@eye: Ha, come in. {I don't know who's the hero or sidekick, {but I'll mince you all equally.";
"local_episodetalk14 "="@blank: Episode 14. The Underlord's Followers@hero: He who gives up what is most precious rules all.@eye: Hmm?@hero: He who gives up what is most precious rules all.@eye: Is this a riddle?@hero: It's written in the temple. {But why must one give up what is precious to rule all?@eye: These temples have to keep prophecies vague if they want to stay in business.@hero: God is just as perplexing as the Underlord.@king: Whew. Finally got here.@hero: Gah! The King!@eye: Gee. What's this dude doing here?@king: How are things?@hero: Things are not well. {The kingdom is in chaos!@king: The princesses are missing, that's why. They say it's a bad sign. {Not to worry, there are many who can keep the monarchy running. There are over 3000 princesses from fallen kingdoms, hehe. {They do say that one must lose what is most precious to rule all?@eye: What are you talking about? (Weirdo.)@king: Hehe… {I'm actually on the demons' side.@hero: ?! Are you kidding me?! {The King is on the side of demons?@king: You'll know, since you've completed the Collecting Ancient Fragments quest. {The Underlord was once worshipped by both demons and humans. I'm a descendant of his human worshippers.@hero: God and the Underlord were worshipped together?@eye: I see… we begin to learn more of the Underlord's past. {But do you know why he was sealed away?@king: We don't know. {Only that the Underlord and demons both disappeared together. {Then history was rewritten so the Underlord would seem to be the cause of all misfortune.@hero: If that's true, I shall find the truth behind history!@eye: Such motivation!@king: He won't find the truth with those levels…";
"local_episodetalk15 "="@blank: Episode 15. The Warrior's Request@hero: Next quest… Collect Dragon Scales? {There's a dragon in the dungeon?@eye: Dragon? It's very rare… {Not sure if the master has picked one. They're hard to clean up after.@sword_cat: Ugh. Dragons, they be scary.@hero: Maybe we should pass up this one.@warrior: Hehe, I've already succeeded. {I bought some at a shop.@eye: That shop really does have everything.@sword_cat: The Black Knight is swift.@warrior: If you haven't the money then go catch a dragon.@hero: Got to see one first if I want to catch one… {Hey, Underlord! Pick a dragon!@eye: Trust in the Underlord's luck.";
"local_episodetalk16 "="@blank: Episode 16. Legendary Item@hero: That sword from the last boss monster, it's a legendary item called Half of Eternity.@eye: …You go boy.@hero: And like its name implies, it was a set item. {There's a shield that goes with it.@eye: If it's so rare, it won't be easy to find.@merchant: I happen to have the shield that goes with it!@hero: Ooh!@eye: Uncanny merchant… {He can smell demand!@merchant: Gold can buy anything. {50,000 in gold, please.@eye: Pricey. {A knight couldn't afford…@hero: Here you go.@eye: ?!!@merchant: Enjoy your purchase!@eye: Where did you get so much money?@hero: I sold the legendary sword. {I need defense more than offense.@eye: …";
"local_episodetalk17 "="@blank: Episode 17. The Disappeared Power@hero: That legendary shield I got that time, it's weird.@eye: What? What now?@hero: The sword had light powers, but the shield doesn't. {Did the merchant rip me off?@eye: That's odd. Without powers, you'll have no added effect and be at a loss…@warrior: Wait! I think I've seen weapons with no powers. {The witches say they were of an element that has now disappeared.@hero: You mean there was another element? {Besides fire, water, wood, and light?@warrior: Ask the witches. {They often come around the dungeon with placards, cheering on the Underlord.";
"local_episodetalk18 "="@blank: Episode 18. The Witches are on the Underlord's Side@witches: The Underlord was wicked today. {Got to have monsters of varied strengths to win, cackle.@hero: Whew~ found it. {You guys the witches who know the Black Knight?@witches: So? Cackles. {What's it to you?@hero: I wanted to ask you about the power that disappeared in the olden times.@witches: A knight interested in such things… amazing! {It's dangerous talk, so we can't say. {If the Temple of Light learns we spoke, we'll be witch-hunted.@hero: I bought a super-expensive item and it had no powers! {I don't want to be an idiot who enters the dungeon without powers…@witches: Then why don't you take a test? {You're a knight so you should be used to quests.@hero: What… is your quest? (Gulp)@witches: You shall help our Underlord. Cackles! {Sacrifice 5 gems so the Underlord can call forth a new monster. {Cackles!@hero: A knight helping the Underlord?! Absurd.@eye: Think of it as… an entrance fee for the hunting grounds!@hero: … Fine. {Getting 5 gems is nothing. Be right back!";
"local_episodetalk19 "="@blank: Episode 19. The Underlord's Past (2)@hero: Took longer than I thought to get 5 gems.@witches: You got them? Now give them to the Underlord.@hero: Fine, fine.@witches: Now we talk. As you may have guessed, the disappeared element is the opposite of light: darkness.@hero: Darkness?!@witches: Once the Underlord was worshipped with God, side-by-side. {God and the Underlord made life forms of various powers and one of those powers was darkness.@hero: The Underlord was a creative god?@witches: Yes. And one day, God threw out the Underlord and the creatures made from darkness, the demons. {Then darkness itself disappeared.@hero: The Underlord was thrown out?@senior_priest: Enough! You wicked witch (B*witch) {Blabbering on like that!@witches: Gah!! Where'd you come from?@senior_priest: Any who talk of the ancient knowledge from the Temple of Light shall face doom!@witches: Humph! The Underlord's infamy rises by the day! {Only a matter of time until the powers of darkness return!@senior_priest: God has forsaken the Underlord. {Mere mortals such as we can never understand, only follow, God's will. That is our place.@hero: Let's get out of here before the High Priest sees us.";
"local_episodetalk20 "="@blank: Episode 20. Unslayable Monster@hero: So this legendary shield was of darkness. {Can't believe I spent so much money on something so useless…@eye: The day the Underlord opens all of the dungeons, darkness may return again!@hero: Taking the Underlord's side just so I can use an item seems a little…@succubus: Hey, knight, {sexy shield you got there.@hero: Gah! A monster outside of the dungeon!@succubus: I felt like getting some fresh air.@eye: Say hi, she used to be a princess.@hero: Princess? {The princess is a succubus now?@succubus: Yeah. Now that I'm here, it's kinda boring.@hero: You're a monster, I don't care about how bored you are!@succubus: So knight, don't you feel like slaying me, or something?@hero: Ungh… the princess I had a crush on… (and my chance for social advancement…!)@succubus: Don't feel so bad for me. {Being a monster opened my eyes to lots of things. {Monsters are like humans, we're all missing something. {Someone has to be on their side.@hero: I can believe you would side with them over us…@succubus: We have to understand the dark side of life, too!";
"local_episodetalk21 "="@blank: Episode 21. God's Threat@hero: How will God strike back when the Underlord takes over the dungeons of all four lands?@warrior: Don't worry. {I shall clear all quests and destroy the Underlord. @sword_cat: Whichever side wins, it's best to have enough money saved up just in case!@hero: In other lands they say, there are warriors at 99 levels.@warrior: 99 levels? Even a warrior with 10,000 levels can't slay a boss monster with one blow.@eye: Idiots! No matter how many levels you get and how many warriors you send, the Underlord has unlimited powers! {Someone in a different dimension is helping him out.@warrior: Humph! Well that someone outside our dimension AND the Underlord better be ready! {Angels are appearing on the Land of Light!@eye: Angels? We have winged demons, too. {Bring them on!";
"local_episodetalk22 "="@blank: Episode 22. The Priests' Purpose@senior_priest: Warriors! Lower the Underlord's infamy, {turn all glory to God!@eye: Hey! You can't just walk into the dungeon! {Take a number!@senior_priest: …@hero: So priest, what's the deal with God and the Underlord? {Why were they friends one minute and enemies the next?@senior_priest: That's… none of our business. {God promises riches only to those who worship him.@hero: Worship is a condition for riches…?@senior_priest: Does that make you uncomfortable? {Aren't we all living for riches? {A priest is someone who aids that system. {No one needs to know the truth. This way, we all win.@hero: What I want to know is the truth! {How did the Underlord and the power of darkness disappear?@senior_priest: If you're so curious, I'll tell you. {After you take care of the boss in this dungeon!@eye: Now THAT'S uncomfortable. If I want to help I've got to let the boss lose to the hero.";
"local_episodetalk23 "="@blank: Episode 23. The Underlord and God@hero: Well, I've managed to kill off the boss monster.@eye: Thanks to that, infamy levels dropped. {Now go to the high priest and ask him about the Underlord's past.@senior_priest: Welcome, hero. You've really cleared the boss monster.@hero: So tell me about the Underlord's past.@senior_priest: Long story short, God and the Underlord ruled together. {But the Underlord went against God's will so God got rid of the demons and darkness. {He erased the Underlord's memory and locked him in the dungeon.@hero: I see. {So demons and humans used to live together?@senior_priest: Demons and humans were cleaved off from each other according to their powers. {They were not separate bodies.@hero: So all the powers used to be in one body but were separated.@senior_priest: These are all things that are beyond us. {All we can do as humans is to lead ourselves through goodness and to want and enjoy good things.@eye: Humans need to confront darkness, too! {Someone has to see the dark side in order for there to be progress. {Else who's going to throw eggs at people wearing fur, who will help the poor?@senior_priest: Halt these idiocies!";
"local_episodetalk24 "="@blank: Episode 24. God Manifests@eye: So before the Underlord was locked away, humans were whole. {Then according to their powers they were divided into angels, mortals, fairies, elves, and demons. @hero: And now that God knows the Underlord has escaped, God will try to lock him back in.@eye: What are you going to do?@hero: I don't… know. {Whom I'm supposed to fight for…?@eye: Gah!@eye_white: …@hero: Wha… the eyeball has turned white!@eye_white: … I am… God…@hero: God? The eyeball is God?@eye_white: God has briefly manifested as this eyeball. It's ugly, but trust me. {I now speak to the being of a different dimension who is helping the Underlord. {If you give up the demons you have amassed so far and leave, I shall spare your life.@hero: Liar! What can even you do to a being beyond our dimension?@eye_white: In-app discounts! Gems! {Your name in the Special Thanks credits!@hero: But those are all good things! {Underlord! Don't lose! You can't lose this!@eye_white: Anyway, I've warned you. {My most powerful armies will descend upon the dungeon. {We'll see how high your infamy can rise!@eye: (Pat!) {Urrrrgh… I'm coming back…@hero: Hey! You OK? God was in your body!@eye: Ugh… I could read some of God's thoughts.@hero: What? Your thoughts were linked while your mind was being controlled? {I think I saw that in a movie…@eye: In a sense. In the Temple of Light there's an Autobiography of God. {The Underlord's past is in that book.@hero: I'm going to go get it!@merchant: You don't have to. I've got it in stock.@eye: Gah!!@merchant: 50,000 in gold, please.";
"local_episodetalk25 "="@blank: Episode 25. Autobiography of God{In the beginning, I was alone.{I wanted an emotion that was precious and true.{ So I made a personality that was different from my own. That was the birth of the Underlord.{We spent eons together creating things and having fun.{ The creations that had the powers of darkness worshipped only the Underlord.{I felt jealous. I began hating the Underlord and his minions.{The Underlord refused to destroy the creations that had darkness in them.{So I erased the Underlord's memory, separated the powers among the creations, and eliminated darkness.{And the separated ones are called demons to this day.";
"local_episodetalk26 "="@blank: Episode 26. Judgment Begins@eye: The secret is out. {The Underlord tried to prevent our extinction… {God wouldn't let him. {And God is still trying to kill the demons.@hero: Confrontation is inevitable.@angel: Puppets of the Underlord! {You will never be forgiven! {Here comes the forces of light!@hero: The angels are attacking!@senior_priest: The angels have astronomical strength levels. {Prepare to meet your doom, Underlord.@eye: Victory at the Land of Light's dungeon will be hard-won. {Let's do our best!@hero: Hey eyeball, I want to fight on your side!@eye: Huh? {A knight fighting on our side?@hero: Yeah! {Call out more demons with my gems!@eye: But what's going to happen to you?@hero: I don't care about my quest anymore.@angel: A human on the side of demons… {Unforgivable! Die!@hero: Arg!! I… die… (plop)@eye: Gah! The knight has died. Looks like bad acting but it's for real. {He died for the demon race…";
"local_episodetalk27 "="@blank: Episode 27. Completion@warrior: So killing the Underlord is the final quest. {I don't think that knight guy is on his quest anymore. {Less competition for me! Hehe. @angel: For your noble work God bestows a blessing.@warrior: A blessing from God?@angel: That is right. {To you it's an ending. {But it's goodbye to your fairy.@angel: I shall make you into a whole being. {The kind of being before humans and demons were separated. {A demon swordsman. {Come forth as a demon swordsman! @warrior: Demon… demon swordsman! Ooh!@eye: He's going to be even more insufferable.@knight: … Uh… so what's new about me?@angel: … Your levels shall have increased a bit.@knight: … I think I got the short end of the stick here.@angel: Anyway! Off to the dungeon!";
"local_episodetalk28 "="@blank: Epilogue@eye: Master, good work! {You've taken down many of your enemies and at this level of infamy, God will see you as a force to be reckoned with.@king: Congratulations! {Good job reading all of these words in the story.@senior_priest: Ungh! Who knew ridding the world of darkness would be so difficult.@hero: Hey eyeball! How are ya?@eye: Gah!! I thought you were dead, knight!@hero: Hehe… I just discovered something amazing.@hero: I'm a knight from another dimension. {There is more than one God and one Underlord.@eye: ?@hero: When darkness was separated from the other powers, the Underlord and his demons were shattered into different fragments. {So warriors, demons, and Underlords all have several manifestations.@eye: There are several masters?!@hero: The Underlord wars that began in several dimensions picked up steam when they came to one place. {Each Underlord can compare on a leaderboard their progress with other Underlords.@eye: Wha… unlimited competition!@hero: The Underlord's challenge begins now! {I will never cease to raise my own levels!@eye: So, there you go. {It feels odd that there are several versions of me. {But what can you do. I hope master also continues to do well in his dimension to become the number one Underlord in existence!@blank: THE END";
"local_episodetalk29 "="@blank: Beginning of the Demon Wars@sword_cat: The Age of Darkness has come. {The scary thing is… the Underlords are keeping each other in check.@eye: What does that mean?@sword_cat: Underlords from other dimensions will from time to time send monsters. {Monsters can flood into the dungeon.@eye: A war between demons.@sword_cat: Monsters can enter randomly, just so you know.@succubus: Save me, sexy kitty swordsman!@sword_cat: Gah! I'm off!";



