 "local_adventureeventmeetmagicianfailed"="Oh no... You picked the losing ticket.";

 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician"="Oh! Demons! I've been waiting for a long time.{For the moment when the Devil resurrects!{Everything falls under the law of cause and effect.{Everything will be consumed by darkness.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician01"="But what is this creation?{I thought the Demon King's monsters would be worth at least 3 or 4 stars...";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician02"="When will we stop being curious about the other world?{I heard that even the dead can't stop thinking about it.{I hope it was an enjoyable journey for you guys, too...";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician03"="The Succubus causes trouble when her lust is not satisfied.{It’s good that she found another monster to mate with.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician04"="How cute! Even little monsters are coming all the way here...{I admire long-lasting endurance.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician05"="However short or fragile, your lives are also a part of nature.{I'm inspired by the animals’ desire to get stronger to protect themselves from human attacks.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician06"="Thieves! Crush the humans’ greed and desires!";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician07"="When will we stop being curious about the other world?{I heard that even the dead can't stop thinking about it.{I hope it was an enjoyable journey for you guys, too...";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician08"="How cute! Even little monsters are coming all the way here...{I admire long-lasting endurance.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician09"="Creatures of love craft!{Cthulhu returns to this land... This is the end of the world.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician10"="Is it Halloween? These monsters seem very familiar..{I can only give you this instead of candy.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician11"="Did you go on this journey just to become EXP for warriors?{Don't neglect leveling up.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician12"="When will we stop being curious about the other world?{I heard that even the dead can't stop thinking about it.{I hope it was an enjoyable journey for you guys, too...";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician13"="Your sword skills are as good as that of the human warriors.{Extinguish their courage and pride!";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician14"="The prophecy that the last of us will eat spaghetti meatballs in order to resurrect the demon Diablo has been fulfilled today.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician15"="I came running when I felt the earth shaking and found you guys here.{I'll give you this so can you keep quiet?";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician16"="Are you Hell’s beauty queens?{I think I know what bad girl power is now.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician17"="No way... the two toughest dragons to control are on an adventure together...{The Demon King this time around is really something.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician18"="What is it this time?{Seeing these rare evil spirits all at once... Just when you think you’ve seen everything in life.....";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician19"="I'm deeply touched by the fact that I’m able to witness giant evil spirits wreaking havoc like this!";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician20"="I'm deeply touched by the fact that I’m able to witness giant evil spirits wreaking havoc like this!";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician21"="I'm deeply touched by the fact that I’m able to witness giant evil spirits wreaking havoc like this!";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician22"="I'm deeply touched by the fact that I’m able to witness giant evil spirits wreaking havoc like this!";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician23"="What is it this time?{Seeing these rare evil spirits all at once... Just when you think you’ve seen everything in life.....";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician24"="Legendary animals all in one place like this... Today must be my lucky day.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician25"="These are mysterious monsters.";
 "local_adventureeventmeetmagician26"="These are mysterious monsters.";
